  "id": "pd",
  "term": "PD",
  "definition": "PD stands for Parkinson disease, a biological condition in which walking can be affected, including slower gait, shorter stride length, and greater variability. In the source, people with PD are described as sometimes improving gait with rhythmic auditory cueing, and these effects are examined in relation to dopaminergic medication status.",
